  "details": "- CVE-2022-1552: run autovacuum, REINDEX and CLUSTER on indexes as the table owner with restricted security context\n- CVE-2022-1552: check operator class ACLs in CREATE INDEX as the original user (8782ce49e4)\n- CVE-2023-2454: prevent CREATE SCHEMA ... schema_element from escaping the search_path\n- CVE-2023-5869: fix integer overflow in array modification functions\n- CVE-2023-5869: detect integer overflow in array_set_slice() on an empty array (6c1b71bc6a)\n- CVE-2024-10979: block environment variable changes from trusted PL/Perl\n- CVE-2025-1094: reject invalidly-encoded strings in libpq quoting functions\n- CVE-2025-1094: quote names in the client encoding in createdb, createuser, dropdb, dropuser, reindexdb and clusterdb\n- CVE-2025-8714: restrict psql meta-commands in plain-text dumps (\\restrict/\\unrestrict); \\unrestrict does not do backquote expansion (2006fca401)\n- CVE-2025-12818: prevent int/size_t overflows in libpq",
